# RDNF negation annotation: @[[without Int]] resolves to Type::Negation(Int) via
# simplify_type(Negation(Int)) in resolve_type_dict. The annotation on a dict key
# is metadata only — no type assertion is performed on the value.
# Verifies that the annotation resolves without error and eval produces the correct output.
[x@[[without Int]]: "hello"]
=== out
Dict({"x": String("hello")})
